{"unit_id":"Num86__dsh-functions#card-zh","repo":"Num86/dsh-functions","commit":"ec157aa6d9e54cf7644e21b6475bc0582b8f2c77","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-functions 是为 DSH 提供可扩展功能栏的插件，在客户端顶部加入「功能」面板，并通过宿主注册表和客户端接口接入其他插件的一键动作。功能可以分组、排序、置顶或组成二级菜单，也可配置确认步骤、显示执行结果，并将动作交给宿主代码或命令执行。插件还内置「加载功能」入口，可把指令发送到当前会话；另有「重启 DSH」功能，可在支持的环境中检查任务状态、分级确认后安排重启。适合希望集中触发插件动作或管理 DSH 重启的用户；无需 API 密钥，重启在 Windows 桌面及 CLI/headless 环境有对应实现。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-13","index.js:175-287","index.js:421-458","restart.js:359-460"]}
{"unit_id":"Num86__dsh-functions#card-en","repo":"Num86/dsh-functions","commit":"ec157aa6d9e54cf7644e21b6475bc0582b8f2c77","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-functions adds a DSH Functions menu for plugin actions. Plugins register grouped shortcuts with confirmations and displayed results. Built-ins send a feature-loading instruction to the current session and offer a confirmed restart on Windows desktop or CLI/headless. No API key needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-13","index.js:175-287","index.js:421-458","restart.js:359-460"]}
